---
layout: layouts/feature.njk
wide: true
title: "Shellui OpenTelemetry: follow a request in your own tool"
description: "Follow one request across Shellui services in an observability tool you run. Traces and metrics export over OTLP. Logs carry trace and span ids."
eyebrow: Developers
heading: Follow one request across your services
lede: See a sign-in, the mail it sends, and the job that follows, in an observability tool you run.
---
{% set code = "rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm" %}
{% set lnk = "font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary" %}
{% set h2 = "text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty text-foreground sm:text-3xl" %}
{% set split = "mt-24 grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16" %}

{% include "otel-trace-visual.njk" %}

<section class="{{ split }}" aria-labelledby="backend">
  <div class="max-w-xl">
    <h2 id="backend" class="{{ h2 }}">Send it to your backend</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">Identity, email, storage, hosting, and ai export traces and metrics over OTLP. Point <code class="{{ code }}">OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT</code> at a collector you run. Leave it empty and export stays off.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">Logs carry <code class="{{ code }}">trace_id</code> and <code class="{{ code }}">span_id</code>. They are not exported over OTLP. In the dev stack, open Jaeger at <a class="{{ lnk }}" href="http://localhost:16686">localhost:16686</a>.</p>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm"><a class="{{ lnk }}" href="https://github.com/shellui/django-commons/blob/main/docs/telemetry.md">shellui-django OpenTelemetry docs</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="min-w-0">
    {% highlight "bash" %}
OTEL_SERVICE_NAME=shellui-identity
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=https://your_collector_host:4318
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_PROTOCOL=http/protobuf
    {% endhighlight %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="{{ split }}" aria-labelledby="alerts">
  <div class="max-w-xl lg:order-2">
    <h2 id="alerts" class="{{ h2 }}">Page on these signals</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">Set the alerts in the backend you run. Shellui does not host them.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">Database and Redis calls with no parent span are dropped. The same calls inside a request stay, and so does outbound HTTP with no parent.</p>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm"><a class="{{ lnk }}" href="https://github.com/shellui/django-commons/blob/main/docs/telemetry.md">Sampling and metric names</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="min-w-0 lg:order-1">{% include "otel-alerts-visual.njk" %}</div>
</section>

<div class="mt-16 sm:mt-24">
  <a href="https://github.com/shellui/django-commons/blob/main/docs/telemetry.md" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md bg-primary px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground shadow-xs hover:opacity-90 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">Read the OpenTelemetry docs</a>
</div>

